# Prototype is mock-only

This repository is a **DEMO** Angular wireframe. Treat every change as disposable-looking but contract-faithful stub work.

- Load data from `src/assets/mock/` or in-repo fixtures. Do not add HTTP clients to customer, ERP, P6, EHS, or warehouse hosts.
- No secrets, tokens, SSO, or production URLs in code, docs, env files, or Automations.
- No real employee, customer, or PHI. Use `EXAMPLE —` role labels and fictional site names.
- Keep the DEMO / mock-data banner visible on primary routes.
- If a screen has no stub, ship an empty/error state — do not invent a live fetch to fill it.
- Deferred journeys (J4–J6) stay documentation-only.
